    },
    {
      "sound_id": "4750_12478_000009_000004",
      "species": "human",
      "category": "male_speech",
      "duration_s": 11.27,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "sha256": "823a5f9d89b2f2c33904c1ce7ce132021fc4032a2c04316e7d27959962801ee0",
      "speaker_id": "4750",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "official_transcript": "So I will first explain the cause whence this sedition arose, and then will give an account of the sedition itself; as also of what settlements made for their government after it was over.",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_name": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International",
      "license_status": "verified_from_dataset_license",
      "human_listening_result": "passed",
      "state_classification": "research_candidate"
    },
    {
      "sound_id": "4750_12478_000012_000003",
      "species": "human",
      "category": "male_speech",
      "duration_s": 23.51,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "sha256": "2d2c0aa3299871286c5127fccabbcc993848b062684ae256ed8a5893d2048a09",
      "speaker_id": "4750",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "official_transcript": "So that it was not a thing that I pretend to give, but only according to the determination of God; I therefore propose it still to be contended for by such as please to put in for it, only desiring that he who has been already preferred, and has already obtained it, may be allowed now also to offer himself for a candidate.",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_name": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International",
      "license_status": "verified_from_dataset_license",
      "human_listening_result": "passed",
      "state_classification": "research_candidate"
    },
    {
      "sound_id": "4750_12478_000012_000005",
      "species": "human",
      "category": "male_speech",
      "duration_s": 19.730041666666665,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "sha256": "66dbda5ea8f17ebcb968e74a5cb200b244327579fe6e637b516283d724e14023",
      "speaker_id": "4750",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "en",
      "official_transcript": "However, he himself will judge again who it shall be whom he would have to offer sacrifices to him, and to have the direction of matters of religion; for it is absurd that Corah, who is ambitious of this honor, should deprive God of the power of giving it to whom he pleases.",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_name": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International",
      "license_status": "verified_from_dataset_license",
      "human_listening_result": "passed",
      "state_classification": "research_candidate"
    },
